<title>AUSTRALIA: Rugby league - Australian rugby league results.</title>
<headline>Rugby league - Australian rugby league results.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Australian rugby league play-off matches played at the weekend.</p>
<p>Played Sunday:</p>
<p> Manly     16  Sydney City	14</p>
<p>Played Saturday:</p>
<p> Canberra  14  St George	  16</p>
<p> Brisbane  16  North Sydney     21</p>
<p>Played Friday:</p>
<p>Cronulla  20  Western Suburbs  12</p>
<p>Schedule for second round of play-off matches:</p>
<p>September 14: Cronulla v Brisbane</p>
<p>September 15: St George v Sydney City</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
